{
  "name": "32 · Recordatorio de backups de base de datos",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 32 · Recordatorio de backups\n\nCada mañana consulta la tabla backups_log y, si el último backup tiene más de 26 h, avisa por Gmail y lo registra en Sheets.\n\nCrea la tabla:\nbackups_log (id serial, finalizado_en timestamptz, resultado text)\n\nTu script de backup debe insertar una fila al terminar:\nINSERT INTO backups_log (finalizado_en, resultado) VALUES (NOW(), 'ok');",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 260
      },
      "id": "nodo_121",
      "name": "Nota de configuración",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "nodo_122",
      "name": "Cada día a las 08:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT MAX(finalizado_en) AS ultimo_backup FROM backups_log WHERE resultado = 'ok';",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo_123",
      "name": "Consultar último backup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        220,
        340
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Postgres (Supabase)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const fila = $input.first().json || {};\nconst LIMITE_HORAS = 26; // margen sobre un backup diario\nconst ultimo = fila.ultimo_backup ? new Date(fila.ultimo_backup) : null;\nconst horas = ultimo ? (Date.now() - ultimo.getTime()) / 3600000 : null;\nconst salida = {\n  ultimo_backup: ultimo ? ultimo.toISOString() : 'nunca',\n  horas_desde_ultimo: horas === null ? -1 : Math.round(horas * 10) / 10,\n  umbral_horas: LIMITE_HORAS,\n  atrasado: horas === null || horas > LIMITE_HORAS,\n  comprobado_en: new Date().toISOString()\n};\nreturn [ { json: salida } ];"
      },
      "id": "nodo_124",
      "name": "Evaluar antigüedad",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond_016",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.atrasado }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo_125",
      "name": "¿Backup atrasado?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "REEMPLAZAR_ID_DOCUMENTO"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Backups"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo_126",
      "name": "Registrar aviso",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        880,
        240
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Google Sheets (OAuth2)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "REEMPLAZAR_responsable@ejemplo.com",
        "subject": "=[Backups] Sin backup correcto desde hace {{ $json.horas_desde_ultimo }} horas",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=El comprobador diario ha detectado un retraso.\n\nÚltimo backup correcto: {{ $json.ultimo_backup }}\nHoras transcurridas: {{ $json.horas_desde_ultimo }} (umbral: {{ $json.umbral_horas }})\n\nLanza el backup manualmente y revisa el cron del servidor. Este aviso seguirá llegando cada mañana hasta que haya un backup reciente.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo_127",
      "name": "Recordatorio por Gmail",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        240
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Gmail (OAuth2)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "nodo_128",
      "name": "Backup al día",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        460
      ]
    }
  ],
